This package installs the VSCodium, a Visual Studio Code fork without Microsoft branding, telemetry and licensing.

Optional runtime dependencies, depending on your hardware:

  - libdbusmenu-glib: Needed to show VSCodium's application menu in the KDE Plasma global menu applet.
  - gvfs: Needed for the "move to trash" functionality when deleting files from within VSCodium instead of
  permanently removing them.

Install them manually if you need them:

  # xbps-install -S libdbusmenu-glib gvfs
